"Aparna Sethi is an Adjuster hero active across southeast Asia in the 1990s and early 2000s."
"She is Ignacio's grandmother, retired temporarily, and teaches at Naya Din."
"She has shoulder-length gray hair and wears jagged-glass earrings."
"She lays lethal electrical traps, among them the old-school Shock Box."
"After the December gym challenge she asked for Max to be sent to her at Naya Din."
